<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<PermissionSetGroup xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
        PermissionSetGroup.Description is capped at 255 characters. The full rationale below
        is security-relevant and was moved here rather than deleted; a comment is repo-only
        and is never sent to the Metadata API, so it can be as long as it needs to be. Do not
        paste this back into <description> verbatim - trim it if it needs to change there.

        Composed access for the Principal persona: read-only View All across Acquisition,
        Disposition, Transaction, Property Management and Contact (brokers), plus read-only
        object access to the IR-record-type Lead/Contact/Account population (DPEG_IR_View -
        the Principal already sees these rows through the role hierarchy above
        Investor_Relations_Manager, and needs the matching object permission to use that
        visibility), plus app/tab visibility for all 4 apps, plus append-only Create on
        Lease/Renewal Activity notes.

        DPEG_Checklist_View ADDED 2026-09-02, CONSOLIDATED PERMISSION PASS (Transaction checklist
        rewrite Phases 1-3 gap closure). Same defect and same fix as DPEG_Junior_Analyst_PSG: this
        group already carried DPEG_Transaction_View (record-page access) but not
        DPEG_Checklist_View, so a Principal opening a deal migrated to the new
        Checklist__c/Checklist_Item__c model hit the identical USER_MODE
        `No such column` failure and saw the checklist cards render their error state.
        DPEG_TaskChecklist_View was NOT a member of this group before this edit and is still not -
        that is a SEPARATE, PRE-EXISTING gap on the Task-model view-only side, out of scope for
        this pass (the task brief named only the DPEG_Checklist_View defect), and is reported
        rather than silently fixed alongside it.
    -->
    <description>Principal persona: read-only View All across Acquisition, Disposition, Transaction, Property Mgmt and Contact; read-only IR object access (via role hierarchy); app/tab visibility for all 4 apps; append-only Create on Lease/Renewal Activity notes.</description>
    <label>DPEG Principal PSG</label>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_Base_Access</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_Apex_Access</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_Acquisition_View</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_Checklist_View</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_Disposition_View</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_Transaction_View</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_PropertyMgmt_View</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_Contact_View</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_IR_View</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_App_Acquisition</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_App_Disposition</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_App_Transaction</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_App_PropertyMgmt</permissionSets>
    <permissionSets>DPEG_LeaseNotes_Create</permissionSets>
</PermissionSetGroup>
